  "body": "Private project backup dated 2026-09-15.\n\nThe repository contains application source, evidence, and full Git history. Release archives separately preserve original mathematics, both hospital IFC schema tracks and their license/model card, the current portable project Store, pending UI files, and the unchanged sealed 5e8 Windows runtime.\n\nAssets are uploaded incrementally. Completion is declared only by the final verified backup-assets-manifest.json and upload receipt. Download every part for the chosen archive label and extract into a new directory. See RESTORE.md for verification and restoration instructions.\n\nCurrent application source is checkpoint 33a. The included sealed runtime is the earlier independently validated 5e8 package; this backup does not relabel it as a 33a runtime. Existing package restrictions and licenses remain applicable. This repository is private; no public redistribution clearance is claimed.\n"
